    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Have you ever had this experience before? When you watch a video or play video games, something goes "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on your screen. Square "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "cubes",
            "ref": "v-cube"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " spread across your screens. When this "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", we call it a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "glitch",
            "zh": "小故障"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It stops the video or game for a short time before everything "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "goes back to normal",
            "ref": "v-go-back-to-normal"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Isn’t it "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Not to everyone. Some artists are in fact "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " glitches in their art. Hsu Tung Han is one such artist from Taiwan, China. He uses glitch art in his wood sculptures."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Han "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " each of his works to be like a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "puzzle",
            "ref": "v-puzzle"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". First, he draws a simple picture on paper. Then he works it out with the help of clay. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", he builds the final version out of wood. Cubes of wood together form human or animal figures. His artworks give people the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that they are looking at computer art."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The artist started making these special wood sculptures in 2010. “Human beings are "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " influenced by digital technology,” Han said. “I hope to express that influence "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " my wood sculptures. This is very "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to me.”"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
